class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775500/extras/c28e35565da0d5db3dc750520e886283.avif?t=1726717108\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2>There are six different endings that are determined by the choices you make. Some choices are obvious in how they will impact the ending, while others are less clear. So be careful in every decision you make.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775500/extras/ff493c68eb66b90c47081a6ce05ef59c.avif?t=1726717108\" width=616 height=346 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Experience history from the perspective of the Red Army in this story-driven FPS game. Make choices that will affect your comrades and the entire world. Fight in historical battles where you put down insurgents, eliminate enemies, and defend the motherland. The fate of the USSR rests in your hands.",
